<title>FRANCE: Cap Gemini, Sun in Java pact.</title>
<headline>Cap Gemini, Sun in Java pact.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>French computer consultancy group Cap Gemini said it had concluded a global technology partnership deal with Sun Microsystems Inc around the Java language.</p>
<p>This will make Cap Gemini Sun's &quot;preferred partner&quot; for Java solutions for Sun clients. Sun will train 200 Cap Gemini experts to use the Java language, developed for the internet and intranet environments.</p>
</text>
